  "id": "vp-acceptance-fail-01",
  "title": {
    "en": "Price Accepted Above the Value Area",
    "bn": "দাম Value Area-র ওপরে স্থির হলো"
  },
  "symbol": "EURUSD",
  "timeframe": "H1",
  "mode": "synthetic",
  "type": "trade-setup",
  "bias": "bearish",
  "outcome": "loss",
  "tags": [
    "volume-profile",
    "acceptance"
  ],
  "module": "16-trading-methodologies",
  "lessonSlugs": [
    "05-volume-profile"
  ],
  "caption": {
    "en": "Same levels, but this time price holds above VAH and builds a new range there. The fade sell at 1.0944 is stopped.",
    "bn": "একই level, কিন্তু এবার দাম VAH-এর ওপরে টিকে সেখানে নতুন range বানায়। 1.0944-এর fade sell stop খেয়েছে।"
  },
  "notes": {
    "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
    "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
  },
  "explanation": {
    "en": "Holding outside the value area signals acceptance of higher prices, and fading it fails.",
    "bn": "Value area-র বাইরে টিকে থাকা উঁচু দাম গ্রহণের সংকেত; তখন fade ব্যর্থ হয়।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "Do not fade a move that is being accepted",
      "bn": "যে move গ্রহণযোগ্য হচ্ছে, তার বিপরীতে fade করবেন না"
    }
  ],
